node_modules/
dist/
*.log

# editor and OS junk
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# keep secrets out of the repo: your API key lives in an env var or an
# untracked file, never in a tracked one
.env
.env.*
.envrc
mise.local.toml
*.pem

# Claude Code's project directory is machine-local: settings in here can hold
# your course API key, and this repo goes public when you ship. Your tracked
# harness is CLAUDE.md (and any AGENTS.md) plus project-local skills under
# .claude/skills/ and subagent definitions under .claude/agents/ --- those are
# plain markdown procedure, not secrets, and are meant to ship and be read as
# process evidence. working-loop writes to .claude/agents/design-critic.md
# mid-build when a recurring failure graduates into a rubric rule --- review
# what actually landed there before committing it, the same as any other diff.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**
.astro/
